\cf2 \cb3 \'a0Spot it
\f1\b0 : Look for functions that interact with\'a0$_GET\'a0,\'a0$_POST\'a0,\'a0$_REQUEST\'a0and perform actions triggered by the user/browser that modify data or perform sensitive actions (e.g., privileged actions or data manipulation). For such actions, you should always check for a nonce.\
Additionally, verify user permissions if the action is restricted to certain roles (e.g., admin, editor).\
When in doubt, play it safe: always check.\
\
